limit by: the condition reaches the read and prunes it, and orders nothing
Read type: Default
Prewhere filter column:  tenant = 5
1
non-deterministic select list: the replicas do not get the condition, so nothing is ordered
Read type: Default
Prewhere filter column:  tenant = 5
1000
untuple: the rewrite takes it, so the read may order itself off the condition
Read type: InOrder
Prewhere filter column:  tenant = 5
1000
